window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"yorick","b":"locke","win":["Skill","Skill","Skill","Skill","Skill","Locke","Skill"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-5","text":"A long even grind: your ghoul zoning and E Mourning Mist marks trade against his Q Ritual Nails poke and E resets - whoever manages graves versus cooldowns better edges ahead."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Both ults raise the stakes: his totem hunts your immobile frame while Maiden backs your all-in - cage him first and the exchange is winnable either way."},{"when":"1st item","text":"His danger spike: W Soul Ignition burst plus the execute totem deletes a caged-in Yorick, so never fight him in open space without minions to block the cage exit for you."},{"when":"Late","text":"Your Maiden split pressure balances his pick threat - trade towers, keep the wave shoved, and only duel with full graves and W ready."}],"wants":{"you":["Four graves banked before every trade","W Dark Procession trapping his E dash path","Split pressure that pulls him off his team"],"foe":["Nail poke stacking you toward totem range","E Ashen Pursuit resets over your cage wall","R Purgatory placed on your immobile frame"]},"early":"Levels 1-3 are a genuine skill stalemate: your ghouls and E Mourning Mist slow zone him off the wave, but his Q Ritual Nails poke and E Ashen Pursuit resets let him kite the swarm - trade grave stacks for his cooldowns, keep Q Last Rites healing you, and neither of you should die here.","mid":"Levels 4-5 stay even around Maiden timing and his dodges, and 6 is a knife-edge: his R totem hunts the least mobile champion in the game, but a well-placed W cage plus ghoul wall body-blocks the all-in and Maiden flips the damage race - fight him where minions and walls crowd his angles.","late":"His first item is the one stage that clearly beats you - burst plus execute deletes a cage-trapped Yorick before Maiden peels - so give ground there. Afterward it evens back out: your Maiden-backed split pressure trades map for map against his execute picks, and full-grave duels remain yours to accept or decline.","whys":["Even on skill at 1 - your ghoul zoning trades against his Silver Stake on-hit poke.","Level 2 stays a skill trade around your E Mourning Mist slow and banked graves.","Level 3 is even as your W cage and ghoul leaps meet his Q poke and W burst.","Levels 4-5 remain skill-dependent - his dodges against your cage-and-ghoul setups.","Level 6 is a knife-edge: his totem hunts your immobile frame, but a timed cage and ghoul wall body-block the all-in.","At first item his burst plus execute totem genuinely deletes you - Purgatory preys on a caged-in immobile bruiser.","Late stays even-to-skill as your Maiden split pressure balances his execute picks."]});
