window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"yorick","b":"zaahen","win":["Skill","Skill","Yorick","Zaahen","Skill","Yorick","Yorick"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 3","text":"Your kit assembles: E Mourning Mist mark into W cage plus the ghoul swarm shreds him while Q Last Rites heals you - force the trade before he learns to cleave."},{"when":"Lvl 4-5","text":"He starts cleaving ghouls with Q and E and out-sustaining your single-target damage - stop fighting into a ready glaive and rebuild graves first."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Maiden turns your all-in into a 2v1, but Grim Deliverance (R) answers it if held on its 110s - drain his cooldowns with a cage feint before the real commit."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Maiden plus full ghouls wins the straight duel - shove, trap, and make him fight the whole graveyard on every wave."}],"wants":{"you":["Grievous Wounds before extended trades","E marks that send the swarm onto him","Maiden duels he has to take shorthanded"],"foe":["Q Darkin Glaive cleaving your ghouls down","E Aureate Rush bursting you past the swarm","R Grim Deliverance saved for Maiden fights"]},"early":"Levels 1-2 are quiet - no ghoul pressure is banked yet and his combo is incomplete, so farm and seed graves. Level 3 is your first strike window: E Mourning Mist's mark sends the swarm leaping onto him, W Dark Procession traps him with them, and Q Last Rites heals you through his answer.","mid":"Levels 4-5 tilt to him as his Q cleave chews through ghouls and its healing outpaces your single-target Q - do not fight without a full graveyard or Grievous Wounds. At 6 it becomes a held-breath even: Maiden makes your all-in a 2v1, but Grim Deliverance (R) flips the fight if he saves it, so feint before you commit.","late":"First item onward the lane is yours again: Maiden plus four ghouls wins the straight duel, so shove him into tower and force fights he must take against the whole graveyard. Two items in your split-push becomes the win condition - he either answers you shorthanded forever or watches towers fall.","whys":["Level 1 is even - both of you farm with no ghoul pressure banked yet.","Level 2 is even as you still lack the full ghoul-and-cage kit.","You take level 3 - E mist into cage plus the ghoul swarm shreds him and heals you.","Levels 4-5 favour him once he cleaves your ghouls and out-sustains your single-target Q.","Level 6 is even - his R answers your Maiden all-in if he holds it.","First item is yours as Maiden plus ghouls win the duel.","Two items in your split-push and ghoul-backed dueling keep you ahead."]});
