window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"yorick","b":"masteryi","win":["Yorick","Yorick","Skill","Skill","Skill","Master Yi","Yorick"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-2","text":"Ghouls plus Last Rites healing bully his single Alpha Strike - it is 20s at rank 1 and he is untargetable mid-dash, so bank graves and zone him."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Maiden makes duels a numbers game he cannot win yet, but Highlander is 85s and immune to slows, so cash the window into plates and CS."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Wuju Style adds true damage on a 14s timer, so armour does nothing - stop taking straight fights and cage-peel instead."},{"when":"2+ items","text":"Your Maiden and full ghoul army out-DPS him in sustained fights again - make him fight the graveyard, never you alone."}],"wants":{"you":["Grave stacks banked every single wave","Cage walls that trap his dash-in","Sustained fights where the swarm piles on"],"foe":["Alpha Strike hopping between your ghouls","Meditate stalling until his item spike","Catching you alone with no graves ready"]},"early":"Levels 1-2 you bully him outright: Mist Walkers chew on him while Q Last Rites heals back his answers, and the W cage turns his single pre-reset Alpha Strike into a trap - zone him off CS, stack graves, and punish Meditate: it is a 10s channel that any CC cancels.","mid":"Level 3 onward his resets let him hop ghoul-to-ghoul and the lane settles into a long skill stretch: your sustain matches his ramp through 4-5, and at 6 the Maiden keeps duels a wash until he spikes. Use the stalemate well - plates, graves, and vision - because his first item breaks it in his favor.","late":"At one item he bursts past the swarm and beats you raw, so weather that era behind cage-peel, wave control, and Grievous Wounds for Meditate. By two-plus items the pendulum returns: Maiden plus a full ghoul army out-DPSes him in any sustained fight, so force the graveyard grind his resets cannot clear.","whys":["Ghouls and Last Rites healing out-trade his bare level-1 kit.","At 2 Mist Walkers and the cage bully his single Alpha Strike.","Level 3 evens: Alpha Strike is 20s but his autos cut it down.","Levels 4-5 stay skill-decided while your sustain matches his ramp.","At 6 Highlander makes him immune to your slow - Maiden keeps it even.","First item and Wuju Style true damage burst past the swarm.","By 2+ items your Maiden and ghoul army out-DPS him in sustained fights."]});
